{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmxcTrRR7Svya2EEmnkC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with Harel, the track called \"כספי (שקלי)\", fund number 13254. But I won't put a shekel in before I talk to you, or maybe to someone at the bank.\n\nWhy that one: Harel is a big name I know. In that line the shares column showed \"0%\" and so did \"מט\"ח\" (foreign currency), so it doesn't sound like a gamble. The yearly return showed \"4.25%\" over 3 years and \"3.08%\" over 5 years, and the management fee was \"0.57%\" a year with \"0%\" on deposits. That's about what my deposit gives, maybe a bit more, and nothing scary. Only now do I see that the header says \"לפני דמי ניהול\" (before the management fee). So I don't know how much is left after they take their 0.57%. And I'm not really sure \"כספי\" means something like a deposit. I'm guessing.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **Screen 1:** It said \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\", so I was in the right place. There were many buttons with names: \"מניות\" (shares), \"S&P 500\", \"אג\"ח ממשלתי\" (government bonds). I didn't click anything.\n- **Screens 2 and 3:** The Harel rows. The share-heavy tracks showed big numbers like \"24.04%\", but I don't touch those.\n- **Screens 4 to 6:** Mor, then Altshuler, then Meitav. I'd never heard of Mor. Meitav also has a \"כספי (שקלי)\" track with almost the same numbers (0.58%, 4.41%). By then I was tired and stopped.\n\n**What I skipped:**\n- The English letters (S&P 500), \"עוקב מדדים\" (index trackers), \"גמיש\" (flexible).\n- The small coloured circles. I couldn't tell the turquoise from the yellow.\n- The little \"?\" signs and the \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\" (what is an investment provident fund) link.\n- Everything after screen 6.\n\n**What I didn't understand:**\n- \"מט\"ח\" (foreign currency) next to a percentage.\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" (less than 3 years): did it lose money, or is it just new?\n- \"כספי (שקלי)\"\n- \"עד 25% מניות\" (up to 25% shares)\n- \"עוד לא דווח\" (not reported yet), with a little orange sign next to it.\n- \"מקור / מחושב\" (source / calculated)\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The black background with pale grey text. Even enlarged it's hard to read, and the small print in the column headers and under the fund names was too pale.\n- Every row is full of numbers and percentages, and that made me anxious.\n- Nowhere does it say plainly which one is safe or what is guaranteed.\n- There's nothing about deposits, and nothing about whether my bank takes too much."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3768,"cache_read_input_tokens":11575,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3768},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e7bef7a5-2505-41d0-9ef6-6d3a467d5fd9","uuid":"2f5d2fe7-0d04-4fc2-84b1-5febb1ac8b75","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:05:30.891Z","request_id":"req_011CgmxcTb3ybKJE9Xq2aE9R"}
